# Local environment files may hold real secrets — never commit them.
# The checked-in template (.env.example) is the one exception and stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Review/screenshot artifacts dropped in the repo root — never committed.
# Scoped to the root so real image assets under public/ and src/ are unaffected.
/s[0-9]*-*.png
/*.view.jpg
